# Test output. Every PNG in here is regenerated by test/shot.mjs, test/gun.mjs
# and test/interior.mjs on demand, and the directory runs to ~95MB. Screenshots
# are how this project verifies itself, not something it ships.
shots/

# Scratch renders and probes.
*.tmp.png
/tmp/

node_modules/
.DS_Store

# Editor and OS noise
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# NOTE: assets/ IS tracked on purpose.
#
# It is 6.8MB of CC0 material from Poly Haven and ambientCG - public domain, no
# attribution required, commercial use fine. Committing it rather than fetching
# it at build time means the repo runs offline and cannot be broken by an
# upstream URL changing. See ASSETS-SOURCING.md for the provenance of each file.
